    {
      "text": "线上四至二十人、同屏最多四人的俯视角乱斗",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Online 4 to 20 players (and in local couch co-op up to 4 players) can engage in fast-paced top-down PvP combat where quick reflexes and roguelite buffs determine the victor.",
